;; cashrealestateconsulting.com — redirect-to-primary records ONLY
;;
;; CUTOVER FILE: use this to DEMOTE cashrealestateconsulting.com from the
;; primary GitHub Pages domain to a redirect that sends visitors to the new
;; primary, cashconsults.com. (It replaces the old
;; cashrealestateconsulting.com-github-pages.zone from the testing phase.)
;;
;; Import this file in the Cloudflare dashboard:
;;   cashrealestateconsulting.com zone -> DNS -> Records ->
;;   Import and Export -> Import DNS records
;;
;; SAFETY: This file is ADDITIVE. A Cloudflare import only ADDS the records
;; listed below — it never deletes or modifies existing records. This file
;; contains NO MX, NO TXT, NO SPF/DKIM/DMARC records, so importing it cannot
;; touch your email configuration.
;;
;; HOW THIS WORKS: the domain stops pointing at GitHub Pages (a Pages site can
;; only serve one custom domain, which is now cashconsults.com). These two
;; proxied records make Cloudflare answer for the hostname — 192.0.2.1 is a
;; reserved documentation IP that never routes anywhere — and a Redirect Rule
;; (created by hand, step 3 below) sends visitors to https://cashconsults.com
;; before the dummy IP is ever contacted. The cf-proxied tags below import the
;; records as Proxied (orange cloud), which is REQUIRED for the redirect.
;;
;; IMPORTANT — do these by hand (see dns/README.md); verified against the
;; 2026-07-07 zone export, in which the only web records are the GitHub Pages
;; ones this repo added during the testing phase:
;;   1. Export a backup of the zone first.
;;   2. DELETE the testing-phase GitHub Pages records so they stop competing
;;      with the redirect:
;;        - the four apex A records (185.199.108-111.153)
;;        - the four apex AAAA records (2606:50c0:800x::153)
;;        - the "www" CNAME -> gignsky.github.io
;;      Touch NOTHING else — KEEP all email records exactly as they are:
;;      the three MX (route1/2/3.mx.cloudflare.net), the SPF TXT, the DKIM
;;      TXTs (cf2024-1._domainkey and *._domainkey), the DMARC TXT, and the
;;      Canva verification TXT.
;;   3. After importing, create the redirect: Rules -> Redirect Rules ->
;;      Create rule -> When: All incoming requests -> Then: Dynamic redirect,
;;      expression:
;;        concat("https://cashconsults.com", http.request.uri.path)
;;      status 302, Preserve query string. Deploy.

$ORIGIN cashrealestateconsulting.com.
$TTL 300

;; Proxied placeholders so Cloudflare answers and the redirect rule fires
cashrealestateconsulting.com.	300	IN	A	192.0.2.1 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:true
www.cashrealestateconsulting.com.	300	IN	A	192.0.2.1 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:true
